# deps and build output
node_modules/
dist/
.tsbuildinfo
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- WHY bun.lock IS TRACKED ---
# every skill here is a package that agents install and run, so the
# versions an agent gets are part of what this repo ships. a lockfile
# pins them.
#
# it matters most for the young packages. the explorer api client is
# the engine's own parser, and the tool box pins its borsh codec to an
# exact version because that library's API may still move. without a
# lock, a clone gets whatever resolves that day, and a skill that
# verified its facts against one build stops matching the next one.
#
# the lockfile diff is also the dependency diff: a change to what a
# skill depends on is visible in the review, not hidden in a manifest.
#
# bun.lock

# python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# the eval workspace: local test runs, not part of the skill
*-workspace/

# the openchamber session's screenshots: local debugging artefacts
.openchamber/
